abstract: "A curated, checked map of 141 sources on how generative AI is changing scientific writing and peer review (2025–2026): eight measured shifts, seven questions where researchers and editors disagree, and eight fixes proposed or tried by journals, conferences, preprint servers and funders. Records are CC0; code is MIT; quoted excerpts remain their authors' and publishers'."
